    {
      "id": 392538,
      "username": "NCP",
      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2024-02-05T07:12:59.290Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/kaimoeller\">@kaimoeller</a>,</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kaimoeller\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"116730\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/f04885/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kaimoeller:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But I do not get the serials automatically into the installation note when I reference delivery note items. Even worse, when I want to submit the installation note, the system complains that the item is missing a serial.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>In version 14, if you make a Delivery Note and later create an installation note, the serial number will be automatically taken from the Delivery Note. Additionally, if the item has serial numbers, it is required because the Installed Quantity in the Delivery Note will be updated based on the serial number.</p>\n<p>Please check the video.</p>\n<video controls=\"\">\n    <source src=\"https://github.com/Nihantra-Patel/view_video/assets/141945075/45ff8118-f6e7-4933-ba16-17abd9fca735\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n<p>I hope this helps.</p>\n<p>Thank You!</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/{size}/66573_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 2,
