      "id": 392673,
      "username": "kaimoeller",
      "name": "Kai-Uwe Moeller",
      "created_at": "2024-02-06T02:10:09.544Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi NCP,<br>\nThanks a lot for the quick response.</p>\n<p>So, I am using 15.10.6. The related item screens for serials are different. That large memo text field in your video that contains the serial numbers still exists in the database, but remains empty as far as I can tell. Found that out when I modified the report.</p>\n<p>Here are screenshots from the current version:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/9/697c8a1fdc101dd3da0285bd2cf8ced542144aea.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/697c8a1fdc101dd3da0285bd2cf8ced542144aea\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/697c8a1fdc101dd3da0285bd2cf8ced542144aea_2_690x353.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"f3aXsYbGZHblWQ9m38KXQiHg066\" width=\"690\" height=\"353\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/697c8a1fdc101dd3da0285bd2cf8ced542144aea_2_690x353.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/697c8a1fdc101dd3da0285bd2cf8ced542144aea_2_1035x529.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/697c8a1fdc101dd3da0285bd2cf8ced542144aea_2_1380x706.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2012×1030 105 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I read some other posts about issues with serial numbers. Looks like there was a significant change in serial number handling that is not yet stable?</p>",
