      "created_at": "2024-02-06T21:50:41.902Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the response <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ncp\">@NCP</a><br>\nBut I think the two linked documents do not apply to my use case.</p>\n<p>The video is interesting but it covers generated serial numbers. My use case is bying items from a manufacturer that come with their own set of numbers. It should not make a difference though.</p>\n<p>Also the video used the serial number handling from previous versions. My screen shots show version 15.</p>\n<p>I’d gladly more details or screenshots.</p>\n<p>Thanks<br>\nKai</p>",
